      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just curious: Shouldn\u0027t espi_fw_reset_module() be done unconditionally every time clock_init is done? Is it always guaranteed that ESPI_RESET_L will be asserted when EC control reaches this point? Could there be any race conditions?",
